expat-rs
========

This repository contains a Rust port of libexpat and a vendored, unmodified
copy of the libexpat C sources used as a test oracle.

Upstream:   https://github.com/libexpat/libexpat
Version:    2.9.0 (tag R_2_9_0)
Commit:     a76b1174c1ea52abb639a4c69d52b630a8a106a2
License:    MIT (see crates/expat-oracle/vendor/expat/COPYING)
Authors:    see crates/expat-oracle/vendor/expat/AUTHORS

  Copyright (c) 1998-2000 Thai Open Source Software Center Ltd and Clark Cooper
  Copyright (c) 2001-2025 Expat maintainers
  (individual files carry additional per-author copyright lines, which are
  preserved verbatim in the vendored copy)

Vendored location: crates/expat-oracle/vendor/expat/
Files: expat/lib/*.c, expat/lib/*.h, expat/lib/.gitignore, expat/COPYING,
       expat/AUTHORS — byte-for-byte copies (verify with scripts/verify-vendor.sh).

Build shims written for this project (not upstream code):
  crates/expat-oracle/shim/expat_config.h
  crates/expat-oracle/shim/oracle.h
  crates/expat-oracle/shim/oracle_trace.c
  crates/expat-oracle/shim/oracle_internals.c

Test vectors under tests/vectors/ that were extracted from libexpat's test
suite (expat/tests/*.c, MIT) carry their upstream file and line in
tests/vectors/PROVENANCE.md and in each vector's header.
